      "surface": "therapies",
      "startUtf16": 4224,
      "endUtf16": 4233,
      "quote": "However, for many therapies, research involving large numbers of patients has provided evidence that the treatment is effective. These evidence-based therapies have been shown to reduce symptoms of depression, anxiety, and other mental disorders. NIMH's health topic pages list some of the evidence-based therapies used to treat specific disorders.",
